Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜小鸟：被散布到全世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们的力量所影响{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安与这个世界的融合！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了阻止这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挑战与心园先生决斗的凯特也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到了巨大的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就在这时！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)不、不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然回来了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)你们两个都没事呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我一直相信着你喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之 皆大欢喜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)大家！ 让你们担心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)游马 凯特他…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧 快斗！ 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 振作点！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)太慢了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磨蹭鬼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V 快斗交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独你这家伙 我绝对不会原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 那么 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 由我们来继承！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵 何等愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然主动 接下剩余生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1750的败局决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来继承…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.05,0:01:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}倒是省了我的事真是求之不得。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我跻身七皇等于已经定下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你的真面目吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么回事啊，这伤害……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在逐渐变为异晶界场。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界场！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦吧，痛苦吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，我们要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗发动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先手抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在发动后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹库里波)库里库里～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虹库里波！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}徒劳之举！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们就到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴尔·泽布尔 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:03:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中发动虹库里波的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库里库里～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虹库里波是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以装备到那只怪兽上…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 被装备的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击将会无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算了无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}余兴就留到之后慢慢享受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把一张卡盖伏在场上回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算是撑过去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）纳修！梅拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙竟然还活着……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候确实应该已经解决了他们两个……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）怎么了？贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……不，没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们当时在地上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了人类的模样作为神代凌牙和璃绪……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？凌牙和璃绪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们失去了作为巴利安时的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为人类生活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这情况相当不妙啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙 连那时候的事都想起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我 把你们俩陷害……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多恩·萨赞德)别慌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多恩·萨赞德！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多恩·萨赞德)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那家伙没有杀气。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那 也就是说他们的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没有完全恢复吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你怀疑我的心情我能理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确我和梅拉格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在人类世界 曾是你们的敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如今 我们已作为巴利安人觉醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 为了守护这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是我们齐心协力之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 如果我显露出背叛的迹象{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到时候 就从背后砍了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和梅拉格的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与巴利安同在！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你干的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界与人类世界的融合。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了千尊主上以外不可能有别人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人把那家伙的力量复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 说不定 是那个苍蝇混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会不会是那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)哈特兰德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 这可是绝佳的机会啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在游马和Astral都不在。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气把地上……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你把游马和Astral
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太小看了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)那帮家伙一定会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们就是这种人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你们力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你们与他们战斗的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)来吧，上！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK！我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤我我我书记！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有我我我怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，发动我我我魔术师的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，从自己的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成与除外的怪兽相同的等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子龙骑士{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}改变场上怪兽的等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我将等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我复仇者和暗影蜥蜴叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39！ 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.01,0:08:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击感染蝇王·别西卜！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵！？ 霍普的攻击力是比对手还低喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.哈特兰德)哼，我已经看穿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让霍普发动攻击，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用月之屏障让那次攻击无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动速攻魔法，双重·提升·机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！我发动反击陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超阶·猎杀！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被对手的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击怪兽的效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，将那个超阶·单位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收为自己的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的超阶·单位！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，攻击已经无法阻止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的希望马上就要消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是被小看了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的胜利方程式是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是这种程度！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻止攻击的方法 还有其他。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从 手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法 停止铁锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效1只怪兽的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使其攻击力下降500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来是对手攻击过来时使用的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我偏偏用在了荷普身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.43,0:10:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}荷普的攻击被阻止了也就是说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双重提升机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当1只怪兽的攻击被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力战斗中 变为２倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.71,0:10:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 感染·巴阿尔·泽布卢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·双重斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 霍普的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗结束时 恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶… 你们这些家伙～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:11:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅… 不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 感染·媒介 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恶魔族怪兽 艾克西斯被破坏的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}５只新的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.93,0:11:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感染·虫·衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气增殖了喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}５只衍生物？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 攻击力只有300。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 小心点。应该有什么招数。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用感染·虫·衍生物1号
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普和300攻击力战斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虫·衍生物的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我造成的伤害变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 破坏对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有！ 给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:12:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成300点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你们的场上就空空如也了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用虫·衍生物2号{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 虹之栗子球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我受到直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地 特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 就用 电子虫衍生物２号。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那个破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 虹之栗子球！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是破灭之秀的开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电子虫衍生物 ３·４·５号的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}三重・直接攻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}击\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为您献上！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电子虫衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进一步 追击伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电子虫扩展！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在未通常召唤怪兽的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将１只电子虫衍生物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这该死的苍蝇又增加了一只。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡发动后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家只能以攻击表示
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连守备表示撑过去都做不到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是破坏感染虫衍生物的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个效果会把自己的怪兽也破坏掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并受到300点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)然后 那家伙的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果再受到攻击的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你们就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完蛋了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们还没完蛋呢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上因为特殊召唤了怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 光之护封！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是将墓地里的1只光属性怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在墓地里的光属性怪兽是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.61,0:14:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！难…难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤!!\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要将墓地里的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这正是快斗留给我们的希望…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往逆转胜利的方程式！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你使用了银河眼的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5只虫衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要怎么一次性除外！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个我的回合，你们就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样结束回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 你懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能颠覆这个局面的那一手。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能不能抽到那张关键卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们在这里拿出的王牌什么的我全都看透了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是异热同心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 没那么容易！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次 赐予我力量～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！ 你已经没有能变成异热同心的力量了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕… 可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很痛苦吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着这么痛苦的心情与其去决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干脆 不回来的话还比较幸福吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑…！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊～？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管有多痛苦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和星光体决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.43,0:16:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.19,0:16:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又能一起决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有比这更幸福的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 那份感情…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的话 我也能理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这点程度的痛苦算什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 只要和你在一起…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.99,0:16:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难 难道说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)超燃啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和我自己 加上你 超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两人构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}羁绊会进化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更强！ 更坚固！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.91,0:17:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光/游马)羁绊相连之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量与心合为一体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光的奇迹与传说就此诞生！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光/游马)泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全新的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.75,0:17:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.51,0:17:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！ 为什么～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽阿尔)神圣之光将卑劣的黑暗净化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔领域！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！？ 巴利安的力量竟然！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者会引导卡片！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以我自身释放的那一点光芒为目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，胜利与希望的卡片。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤泽阿尔·伺服·放逐·贤者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，胜利的方程式就完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击1只感染虫衍生物！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间，银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对方怪兽一起被除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不是破坏，而是除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感染虫衍生物的效果不会发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！但这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果已经不能再用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我的胜利～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时，放逐·贤者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽被除外时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽呼唤回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于放逐圣者的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比被呼唤回来的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力低的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上 所有的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都被除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的攻击力是 3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力300的漏洞衍生物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部被除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把哈特兰击溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可… 可恶…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这颗燃烧之心的心灵之地竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.35,0:20:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在……在燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我竟然 在燃烧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好烫～！烫烫烫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烫！烫！贝……贝库塔大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在燃烧啊！为……为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔大人～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.01,0:21:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 那不是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.03,0:21:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《咚·千》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 游马 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之就是完全复活了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪亮亮喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再说一次，欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家，我回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.10,0:21:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，快斗大人，您平安无事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助变成巴利安了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～为什么啊…为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，快看！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.04,0:23:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.51,0:23:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.54,0:23:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.39,0:24:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
